Limite 1B Violetto MLX 4-bit conversion

Original model: paradigma-inc/limite-1b-violetto, by Paradigma.
Original model and reference implementation: Apache License 2.0.
Reference implementation: https://github.com/paradigma-inc/limite-violetto

MLX architecture implementation: pierjoe/limite-mlx, version 0.1.0,
revision b21b7a4fa6ca05cb02082d9f7819b8d1387f2f1a, Apache License 2.0.
The adapter is an external dependency, not an original implementation by this project.

Derivative changes: MLX conversion, folding of learned attention projection
scales by the adapter, affine 4-bit/group-64 weight quantization, and acceptance
of both upstream end-token IDs 151643 and 151645. No fine-tuning was performed.
The original tokenizer and fixed mathematical chat template are preserved.
